# Project Rules for HireFound

## Typography & Copywriting
- **NO EM DASHES**: Never use em dashes (`—` or `&mdash;`) anywhere across this site, UI text, or code comments. Use standard hyphens (`-`), commas, colons, or clean sentence breaks instead.

## Reminders & Next Priorities
- **REMIND USER AT START OF NEXT SESSION**: Review and refine the social media live preview cards (Open Graph and Twitter previews for homepage and jobs page).
